# Growth mandate (Idle Party)

**Locked 2026-09-12.** Source: `docs/GROWTH_MANDATE.md` (research-checked).
Program 1 (time-to-combat + funnel) shipped 2026-09-12.

Default work is **Program 2** — hide chrome until it means something + Play
smoke. Vague “gör bättre / vad härnäst” → next **unchecked** box on
**Program 2**. AL20 play notes are a **quality gate**. They are not the batch.
Endgame copy / GEAR follow-up only when the owner’s notes say they lie.

## Do this

- First-hour bar: GOLD after first reward; SHOP after first boss; ESSENCE
  when essence exists. BAG Shop-chip off until then.
- TODAY grow-the-party beats EQUIP / MARKET until the first boss
- Starter kit HUD (PROT / DISC / FIRE) stays readable
- Cadence 2–3 weeks; new-player What’s New; DPS HIGH still fails CI
- Owner: Play publish + SHOP/POWERUPS smoke on a Play install

## Do not do

- New zone / class / God Hand redesign / second sim / gacha / iOS / web product
- AL20 chase/wipe polish as the default slice
- God-object cleanup as the quarter’s story
- Scaled paid UA before D1 is known (tiny spend ≠ a D1 study)
- Repeat the Robban line for Program 1 (that bar is history)

